{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-04-05 04:00:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX ENTERS AFRICA, CLOSING THE US$320 MILLION ACQUISITION OF MAINONE', 'text': "ACQUISITION SIGNALS THE FIRST STEP IN EQUINIX'S LONG-TERM STRATEGY TO BECOME A LEADING AFRICAN CARRIER-NEUTRAL DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY, ENABLING ORGANIZATIONS TO ACCELERATE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION THROUGHOUT THE CONTINENT REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , APRIL 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC. \xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX),\xa0THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED ITS DEAL TO ACQUIRE WEST AFRICAN DATA CENTER AND CONNECTIVITY SOLUTIONS PROVIDER MAINONE FOR AN ENTERPRISE VALUE OF US$320M, MARKING THE BEGINNING OF ITS EXPANSION INTO THE AFRICAN CONTINENT."}